{"type":"message","id":"96e6cf5d","parentId":"ed08346b","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:18:45.339Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_OIQNkR9FdGyaVTsFZn4BVZUo","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/wordpress/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":1569,"output":65,"cacheRead":7808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9442,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779265124198,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhWQbDaJuSKriuDuQ4o2QgNBbBK3H"}}
{"type":"message","id":"86bef262","parentId":"96e6cf5d","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:18:45.386Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_OIQNkR9FdGyaVTsFZn4BVZUo","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"error\",\n  \"tool\": \"read\",\n  \"error\": \"ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/wordpress/SKILL.md'\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"error","tool":"read","error":"ENOENT: no such file or directory, access '/home/bhard/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/wordpress/SKILL.md'"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779265125386}}
{"type":"message","id":"85ffea2f","parentId":"86bef262","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:18:46.267Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_MFITpoEAfeBwzWuf4kUuDayB","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":3716,"output":57,"cacheRead":5760,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9533,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779265125388,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhWQcqIYFGydqe43W7xQElvIFo5BD"}}
{"type":"message","id":"be750b37","parentId":"85ffea2f","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:18:46.292Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_MFITpoEAfeBwzWuf4kUuDayB","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Skill: wordpress\n\n## What This Skill Does\nPublishes a crypto news article to WordPress as a **draft** post. Uploads feature and chart images, strips the writer META block from the body, converts markdown to **Gutenberg blocks** (same format as pasting into the default block editor), creates the post, then sets **Rank Math** SEO via `POST /wp-json/rankmath/v1/updateMeta`.\n\n## How to Invoke\n\n```bash\nbash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh\n```\n\nAll arguments are **optional** — title, excerpt, slug, and focus keyword are read from the META block in `/tmp/crypto-article.md`.\n\n## Pipeline Phases\n\n1. **Parse META** — SEO Title, Meta Description, URL Slug, Primary Keyword; strip META from body.\n2. **Images** — Feature + chart upload; chart placeholders replaced in markdown.\n3. **HTML** — Pandoc → HTML; remove duplicate H1; **`html_to_gutenberg.py`** → `<!-- wp:paragraph -->`, `<!-- wp:heading -->`, etc. inside a constrained group block.\n4. **WordPress post** — `POST /wp/v2/posts` (draft, category 3).\n5. **Rank Math** — `POST /rankmath/v1/updateMeta` (fatal if it fails).\n\n## Layout note (Divi theme)\n\n- **“, Divi” in the posts list** only means you opened **Divi Builder** on that draft — not a different post type.\n- **Narrow one-sided layout** on old API posts was caused by **raw HTML** in `content`. New publishes use **Gutenberg blocks** so layout matches manual paste in the default editor.\n- Optional wp-admin: **Divi Post Settings → Layout → Fullwidth** for extra full-page width.\n\n## `/tmp/wp-result.json`\n\n| Field | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `content_format` | `gutenberg_blocks` when block conversion ran |\n| `rank_math_applied` | Rank Math SEO updated |\n| `seo_title` / `focus_keyword` | Values sent to Rank Math |\n| `meta_stripped` | META removed from body |\n\n## Return Values\n\n| Exit Code | Meaning |\n|---|---|\n| `0` | Draft URL in `/tmp/wp-result.txt` |\n| `1` | Error in `/tmp/wp-error.log` |\n\n## Post Configuration\n\n| Setting | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Site | `https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com` |\n| Status | `draft` |\n| Category | ID `3` (Crypto News) |\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779265126292}}
{"type":"message","id":"7f0e68db","parentId":"be750b37","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:18:47.403Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_MbaP1wCc6ZE2D5E4fWFqflMN","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/wordpress/publish.sh"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4-mini","usage":{"input":745,"output":74,"cacheRead":9344,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10163,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779265126294,"responseId":"chatcmpl-DhWQd1p4nzdh42ZbXfgEc5LNbWc74"}}
{"type":"message","id":"3fe18e99","parentId":"7f0e68db","timestamp":"2026-05-20T08:18:47.426Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_MbaP1wCc6ZE2D5E4fWFqflMN","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# =============================================================================\n# publish.sh — WordPress Publishing Skill for Scribe (wp-publisher agent)\n# =============================================================================\n# Usage:\n#   bash publish.sh [--title \"Title\"] [--excerpt \"Excerpt\"]\n#                  [--article /path/to/article.md] [--image /path/to/image.jpg]\n#\n# Smart extraction: reads SEO Title, Meta Description, URL Slug directly from\n# the Writer's META block in the article — no manual passing needed.\n#\n# Pipeline cleanup: strips META block, Word Count line, and thinking blocks\n# before publishing so only clean article content reaches WordPress.\n#\n# Output:\n#   Exit 0 → /tmp/wp-result.txt contains the WordPress draft post URL\n#   Exit 1 → /tmp/wp-error.log  contains the human-readable error reason\n# =============================================================================\n\nset -euo pipefail\n\n# --- Config ------------------------------------------------------------------\nWP_URL=\"https://slateblue-reindeer-775070.hostingersite.com\"\nWP_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/wp/v2\"\nRM_API=\"${WP_URL}/wp-json/rankmath/v1\"\nWP_USER=\"spearmintmarketingpro@gmail.com\"\nWP_PASS=\"B1u0 7AQI Aw5a IQK7 0KWX PtGU\"\nCATEGORY_ID=3\nPOST_STATUS=\"draft\"\n\nARTICLE_PATH=\"/tmp/crypto-article.md\"\nIMAGE_PATH=\"/tmp/crypto-feature.jpg\"\nCLEAN_MD=\"/tmp/crypto-article-clean.md\"\nHTML_PATH=\"/tmp/crypto-article.html\"\nRESULT_FILE=\"/tmp/wp-result.txt\"\nERROR_FILE=\"/tmp/wp-error.log\"\nMAX_RETRIES=3\n\n# --- Argument Parsing --------------------------------------------------------\nTITLE=\"\"\nEXCERPT=\"\"\n\nwhile [[ $# -gt 0 ]]; do\n  case \"$1\" in\n    --title)   TITLE=\"$2\";   shift 2 ;;\n    --excerpt) EXCERPT=\"$2\"; shift 2 ;;\n    --article) ARTICLE_PATH=\"$2\"; shift 2 ;;\n    --image)   IMAGE_PATH=\"$2\";   shift 2 ;;\n    *) shift ;;\n  esac\ndone\n\n# --- Helpers -----------------------------------------------------------------\nlog_info()  { echo \"[INFO]  $*\"; }\nlog_error() { echo \"[ERROR] $*\" | tee -a \"$ERROR_FILE\"; }\nfatal()     { log_error \"$*\"; exit 1; }\n\n# --- Setup -------------------------------------------------------------------\nrm -f \"$ERROR_FILE\" \"$RESULT_FILE\" \"$CLEAN_MD\" \"$HTML_PATH\" /tmp/wp-meta.txt\n\nif [ ! -f \"$ARTICLE_PATH\" ]; then\n  fatal \"Article not found at '$ARTICLE_PATH'. Has the Writer agent run yet?\"\nfi\n\n# =============================================================================\n# PHASE 0: Extract metadata from META block + produce clean article\n# =============================================================================\nlog_info \"Parsing article — extracting metadata and stripping pipeline internals...\"\n\npython3 - <<PYEOF\nimport re\n\nwith open(\"${ARTICLE_PATH}\", \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    raw = f.read()\n\nmeta_title = \"\"\nmeta_desc  = \"\"\nmeta_slug  = \"\"\nfocus_kw   = \"\"\nmeta_found = False\n\ndef meta_line(block, label):\n    m = re.search(\n        rf\"^\\s*(?:[-*]\\s*)?{re.escape(label)}:\\s*(.+)$\",\n        block,\n        re.MULTILINE,\n    )\n    return m.group(1).strip() if m else \"\"\n\nmeta_hdr = re.search(r\"^META\\s*$\", raw, re.MULTILINE)\nif meta_hdr:\n    meta_found = True\n    after = raw[meta_hdr.end() :].lstrip(\"\\n\")\n    h1_m = re.search(r\"^#\\s\", after, re.MULTILINE)\n    dash_m = re.search(r\"^---\\s*$\", after, re.MULTILINE)\n    end = len(after)\n    if h1_m:\n        end = min(end, h1_m.start())\n    if dash_m:\n        end = min(end, dash_m.start())\n    block = after[:end]\n    meta_title = meta_line(block, \"SEO Title\")\n    meta_desc = meta_line(block, \"Meta Description\")\n    meta_slug = meta_line(block, \"URL Slug\").lower()\n    focus_kw = meta_line(block, \"Primary Keyword\")\n    clean = raw[: meta_hdr.start()] + after[end:].lstrip(\"\\n\")\nelse:\n    clean = raw\n\nclean = re.sub(r\"<thinking>.*?</thinking>\", \"\", clean, flags=re.DOTALL | re.IGNORECASE)\nclean = re.sub(r\"^\\[?Word Count:.*?\\]?\\s*$\", \"\", clean, flags=re.MULTILINE | re.IGNORECASE)\nclean = re.sub(r\"\\n{3,}\", \"\\n\\n\", clean)\nclean = clean.strip() + \"\\n\"\n\nwith open(\"/tmp/wp-meta.txt\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as mf:\n    mf.write(\"META_FOUND=\" + (\"1\" if meta_found else \"0\") + \"\\n\")\n    mf.write(\"META_TITLE=\" + meta_title + \"\\n\")\n    mf.write(\"META_DESC=\" + meta_desc + \"\\n\")\n    mf.write(\"META_SLUG=\" + meta_slug + \"\\n\")\n    mf.write(\"FOCUS_KEYWORD=\" + focus_kw + \"\\n\")\n\nwith open(\"${CLEAN_MD}\", \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(clean)\n\nprint(\"[INFO]  META block found:\" if meta_found else \"[INFO]  META block not found\")\nprint(f\"[INFO]    SEO Title:        {meta_title[:70]}\")\nprint(f\"[INFO]    Meta Description: {meta_desc[:80]}\")\nprint(f\"[INFO]    URL Slug:         {meta_slug}\")\nprint(f\"[INFO]    Focus Keyword:    {focus_kw[:60]}\")\nprint(f\"[INFO]  Clean article written to ${CLEAN_MD}\")\nPYEOF\n\n# --- Read extracted meta into bash -------------------------------------------\nEXTRACTED_TITLE=\"\"\nEXTRACTED_DESC=\"\"\nEXTRACTED_SLUG=\"\"\nFOCUS_KEYWORD=\"\"\nMETA_FOUND=\"0\"\n\nif [ -f /tmp/wp-meta.txt ]; then\n  while IFS='=' read -r key value; do\n    case \"$key\" in\n      META_FOUND)   META_FOUND=\"$value\" ;;\n      META_TITLE)   EXTRACTED_TITLE=\"$value\" ;;\n      META_DESC)    EXTRACTED_DESC=\"$value\"  ;;\n      META_SLUG)    EXTRACTED_SLUG=\"$value\"  ;;\n      FOCUS_KEYWORD) FOCUS_KEYWORD=\"$value\" ;;\n    esac\n  done < /tmp/wp-meta.txt\n  rm -f /tmp/wp-meta.txt\nfi\n\n# --- Resolve final title (CLI → META block → H1 → date fallback) -------------\nif [ -z \"$TITLE\" ]; then\n  if [ -n \"$EXTRACTED_TITLE\" ]; then\n    TITLE=\"$EXTRACTED_TITLE\"\n    log_info \"Title source: META block SEO Title\"\n  else\n    TITLE=$(grep -m 1 \"^# \" \"$CLEAN_MD\" 2>/dev/null | sed 's/^# //' || echo \"\")\n    [ -z \"$TITLE\" ] && TITLE=\"Crypto News - $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\"\n    log_info \"Title source: H1 heading (META block not found)\"\n  fi\nfi\n\n# --- Resolve final excerpt (CLI → META description → first 3 body lines) -----\nif [ -z \"$EXCERPT\" ]; then\n  if [ -n \"$EXTRACTED_DESC\" ]; then\n    EXCERPT=\"$EXTRACTED_DESC\"\n    log_info \"Excerpt source: META block Meta Description\"\n  else\n    EXCERPT=$(grep -v \"^#\" \"$CLEAN_MD\" 2>/dev/null | grep -v \"^[[:space:]]*$\" | \\\n              head -3 | tr '\\n' ' ' | sed 's/[[:space:]]\\+/ /g' | cut -c1-300 || echo \"\")\n    log_info \"Excerpt source: first body paragraphs\"\n  fi\nfi\n\nSLUG=\"$EXTRACTED_SLUG\"\n\nlog_info \"Final Title:   $TITLE\"\nlog_info \"Final Slug:    ${SLUG:-<WordPress auto-generate>}\"\nlog_info \"Focus Keyword: ${FOCUS_KEYWORD:-<none>}\"\nlog_info \"Post Status:   $POST_STATUS | Category ID: $CATEGORY_ID\"\n\n# Alt text for uploaded media (feature + chart)\nMEDIA_ALT_TEXT=\"$FOCUS_KEYWORD\"\n[ -z \"$MEDIA_ALT_TEXT\" ] && MEDIA_ALT_TEXT=\"$TITLE\"\n\npatch_media_alt() {\n  local mid=\"$1\"\n  local alt=\"$2\"\n  [ -z \"$mid\" ] || [ \"$mid\" = \"0\" ] || [ -z \"$alt\" ] && return 0\n  local resp http payload\n  payload=$(ALT_TEXT=\"$alt\" python3 -c 'import json, os; print(json.dumps({\"alt_text\": os.environ[\"ALT_TEXT\"]}))')\n  resp=$(curl --silent --write-out \"\\n__STATUS__%{http_code}\" \\\n    --user \"${WP_USER}:${WP_PASS}\" \\\n    --request POST \"${WP_API}/media/${mid}\" \\\n    --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    --data \"$payload\" \\\n    --max-time 30)\n  http=$(echo \"$resp\" | tail -1 | sed 's/__STATUS__//')\n  if [ \"$http\" = \"200\" ]; then\n    log_info \"Media ID $mid alt_text set.\"\n  else\n    log_error \"Media alt_text update failed for ID $mid (HTTP $http).\"\n  fi\n}\n\n# =============================================================================\n# PHASE 1: Upload Featured Image\n# =============================================================================\nMEDIA_ID=0\n\nEFFECTIVE_IMAGE=\"$IMAGE_PATH\"\nif [ -f \"$IMAGE_PATH\" ]; then\n  EFFECTIVE_IMAGE=$(readlink -f \"$IMAGE_PATH\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"$IMAGE_PATH\")\nfi\n\nif [ -f \"$EFFECTIVE_IMAGE\" ]; then\n  FILE_SIZE=$(stat -c%s \"$EFFECTIVE_IMAGE\" 2>/dev/null || stat -f%z \"$EFFECTIVE_IMAGE\" 2>/dev/null || echo 0)\n  if [ \"$FILE_SIZE\" -gt 51200 ]; then\n    log_info \"Uploading featured image from $EFFECTIVE_IMAGE ($FILE_SIZE bytes)...\"\n\n    MEDIA_RESPONSE=$(curl --silent --write-out \"\\n__STATUS__%{http_code}\" \\\n      --user \"${WP_USER}:${WP_PASS}\" \\\n      --request POST \"${WP_API}/media\" \\\n      --header \"Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=crypto-feature.jpg\" \\\n      --header \"Content-Type: image/jpeg\" \\\n      --data-binary @\"$EFFECTIVE_IMAGE\" \\\n      --max-time 60)\n\n    MEDIA_BODY=$(echo \"$MEDIA_RESPONSE\" | sed '$d')\n    MEDIA_STATUS=$(echo \"$MEDIA_RESPONSE\" | tail -1 | sed 's/__STATUS__//')\n    log_info \"Image upload: HTTP $MEDIA_STATUS\"\n\n    if [ \"$MEDIA_STATUS\" = \"201\" ] || [ \"$MEDIA_STATUS\" = \"200\" ]; then\n      MEDIA_ID=$(echo \"$MEDIA_BODY\" | python3 -c \\\n        \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin).get('id', 0))\" 2>/dev/null || echo 0)\n      log_info \"Image uploaded. Media ID: $MEDIA_ID\"\n      patch_media_alt \"$MEDIA_ID\" \"$MEDIA_ALT_TEXT\"\n    elif [ \"$MEDIA_STATUS\" = \"401\" ] || [ \"$MEDIA_STATUS\" = \"403\" ]; then\n      log_error \"Image upload auth error (HTTP $MEDIA_STATUS). Proceeding without image.\"\n    else\n      log_error \"Image upload failed (HTTP $MEDIA_STATUS). Proceeding without featured image.\"\n    fi\n  else\n    log_error \"Image file too small ($FILE_SIZE bytes). Skipping.\"\n  fi\nelse\n  log_info \"No image at '$IMAGE_PATH'. Publishing without featured image.\"\nfi\n\n# =============================================================================\n# PHASE 1.5: Upload Chart Image & Embed\n# =============================================================================\nCHART_PATH=\"/tmp/chart.png\"\nEFFECTIVE_CHART=\"$CHART_PATH\"\n[ -f \"$CHART_PATH\" ] && EFFECTIVE_CHART=$(readlink -f \"$CHART_PATH\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"$CHART_PATH\")\nEXPECTED_PH=$(tr -d '[:space:]' < /tmp/expected_placeholders.txt 2>/dev/null || echo \"0\")\nEXPECTED_PH=${EXPECTED_PH:-0}\nCHART_UPLOADED=false\nCHART_URL=\"\"\nCHART_MEDIA_ID=0\nif [ -f \"$EFFECTIVE_CHART\" ]; then\n  log_info \"Uploading chart image from $EFFECTIVE_CHART...\"\n  CHART_RESPONSE=$(curl --silent --write-out \"\\n__STATUS__%{http_code}\" \\\n    --user \"${WP_USER}:${WP_PASS}\" \\\n    --request POST \"${WP_API}/media\" \\\n    --header \"Content-Disposition: attachment; filename=chart.png\" \\\n    --header \"Content-Type: image/png\" \\\n    --data-binary @\"$EFFECTIVE_CHART\" \\\n    --max-time 60)\n\n  CHART_BODY=$(echo \"$CHART_RESPONSE\" | sed '$d')\n  CHART_STATUS=$(echo \"$CHART_RESPONSE\" | tail -1 | sed 's/__STATUS__//')\n\n  if [ \"$CHART_STATUS\" = \"201\" ] || [ \"$CHART_STATUS\" = \"200\" ]; then\n    CHART_URL=$(echo \"$CHART_BODY\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin).get('source_url', ''))\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"\")\n    CHART_MEDIA_ID=$(echo \"$CHART_BODY\" | python3 -c \"import json,sys; print(json.load(sys.stdin).get('id', 0))\" 2>/dev/null || echo 0)\n    if [ -n \"$CHART_URL\" ]; then\n      log_info \"Chart uploaded. URL: $CHART_URL\"\n      CHART_UPLOADED=true\n      patch_media_alt \"$CHART_MEDIA_ID\" \"Crypto price chart — ${MEDIA_ALT_TEXT}\"\n      # Robust replacement: handles [CHART_PLACEHOLDER], markdown image local paths,\n      # and any bare /tmp/chart.png references the LLM may have embedded\n      python3 - <<PYEOF\nimport re, os\n\nchart_url = \"${CHART_URL}\"\nclean_md  = \"${CLEAN_MD}\"\nimg_tag   = f'<img src=\"{chart_url}\" alt=\"Crypto Price Chart\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;\"/>'\n\nwith open(clean_md, \"r\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    content = f.read()\n\ncontent = content.replace(\"[CHART_PLACEHOLDER]\", img_tag)\ncontent = re.sub(r'!\\[[^\\]]*\\]\\(/tmp/chart\\.png\\)', img_tag, content)\ncontent = content.replace(\"/tmp/chart.png\", chart_url)\n\nwith open(clean_md, \"w\", encoding=\"utf-8\") as f:\n    f.write(content)\n\nprint(\"[INFO]  Chart references replaced in article.\")\nPYEOF\n    fi\n  else\n    log_error \"Chart upload failed (HTTP $CHART_STATUS). Proceeding without chart.\"\n  fi\nelse\n  log_info \"No chart generated at '$CHART_PATH'.\"\nfi\n\n# =============================================================================\n# PHASE 2: Convert Clean Markdown → HTML\n# =============================================================================\n\n⚠️ [... middle content omitted — showing head and tail ...]\n\nfi\n\nlog_info \"Updating Rank Math SEO via ${RM_API}/updateMeta (max $MAX_RETRIES attempts)...\"\n\nRM_RETRY_DELAY=5\nRM_HTTP=\"\"\nRM_BODY=\"\"\n\nfor attempt in $(seq 1 $MAX_RETRIES); do\n  log_info \"Rank Math attempt $attempt of $MAX_RETRIES...\"\n\n  RM_PAYLOAD=$(python3 - <<PYEOF\nimport json\n\nmeta = {}\ntitle = \"\"\"${EXTRACTED_TITLE}\"\"\"\ndesc = \"\"\"${EXTRACTED_DESC}\"\"\"\nkw = \"\"\"${FOCUS_KEYWORD}\"\"\"\nslug = \"\"\"${SLUG}\"\"\"\n\nif title:\n    meta[\"rank_math_title\"] = title\nif desc:\n    meta[\"rank_math_description\"] = desc\nif kw:\n    meta[\"rank_math_focus_keyword\"] = kw\nif slug:\n    meta[\"permalink\"] = slug\n\nprint(json.dumps({\n    \"objectID\": int(\"${POST_ID}\"),\n    \"objectType\": \"post\",\n    \"meta\": meta,\n}))\nPYEOF\n)\n\n  RM_RESPONSE=$(curl --silent --write-out \"\\n__STATUS__%{http_code}\" \\\n    --user \"${WP_USER}:${WP_PASS}\" \\\n    --request POST \"${RM_API}/updateMeta\" \\\n    --header \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n    --data \"$RM_PAYLOAD\" \\\n    --max-time 45)\n\n  RM_BODY=$(echo \"$RM_RESPONSE\" | sed '$d')\n  RM_HTTP=$(echo \"$RM_RESPONSE\" | tail -1 | sed 's/__STATUS__//')\n  log_info \"Rank Math response: HTTP $RM_HTTP\"\n\n  [ \"$RM_HTTP\" = \"401\" ] && fatal \"Rank Math auth failed (401). Check Application Password.\"\n  [ \"$RM_HTTP\" = \"403\" ] && fatal \"Rank Math permission denied (403).\"\n  [ \"$RM_HTTP\" = \"404\" ] && fatal \"Rank Math API not found (404). Is Rank Math active?\"\n\n  if [ \"$RM_HTTP\" = \"200\" ]; then\n    RANK_MATH_APPLIED=true\n    log_info \"Rank Math SEO fields updated.\"\n    break\n  fi\n\n  log_error \"Rank Math transient error (HTTP $RM_HTTP). Body: ${RM_BODY:0:200}\"\n  sleep \"$RM_RETRY_DELAY\"\n  RM_RETRY_DELAY=$((RM_RETRY_DELAY * 2))\ndone\n\nif [ \"$RANK_MATH_APPLIED\" != \"true\" ]; then\n  fatal \"Rank Math updateMeta failed after $MAX_RETRIES attempts. Last HTTP: $RM_HTTP. Body: ${RM_BODY:0:300}\"\nfi\n\necho \"$POST_URL\" > \"$RESULT_FILE\"\n\n# Count remaining placeholders (should be 0)\nREMAINING_PH=$(grep -c '\\[CHART_PLACEHOLDER\\]' \"$CLEAN_MD\" 2>/dev/null || true)\nREMAINING_PH=${REMAINING_PH:-0}\nREPLACED_PH=0\nREPLACED_PH=$(( EXPECTED_PH - REMAINING_PH ))\n\nlog_info \"================================================\"\nlog_info \"SUCCESS — WordPress draft saved!\"\nlog_info \"  Post ID:   $POST_ID\"\nlog_info \"  Post URL:  $POST_URL\"\nlog_info \"  Title:     $TITLE\"\nlog_info \"  Slug:      ${SLUG:-<auto>}\"\nlog_info \"  Image ID:  $MEDIA_ID\"\nlog_info \"  Status:    $POST_STATUS (draft)\"\nlog_info \"  Chart placeholders: expected=$EXPECTED_PH replaced=$REPLACED_PH remaining=$REMAINING_PH\"\nlog_info \"  Rank Math SEO:     applied\"\nlog_info \"  Focus keyword:     ${FOCUS_KEYWORD:-<none>}\"\nlog_info \"================================================\"\nlog_info \"Clean article: $CLEAN_MD\"\nlog_info \"Review draft:  $POST_URL?preview=true\"\n\n# Write structured JSON result for orchestrator\npython3 - <<PYEOF\nimport json\nresult = {\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"post_id\": \"${POST_ID}\",\n  \"draft_url\": \"${POST_URL}\",\n  \"post_status\": \"${POST_STATUS}\",\n  \"feature_image_uploaded\": ${MEDIA_ID} != 0,\n  \"chart_uploaded\": \"${CHART_UPLOADED}\" == \"true\",\n  \"chart_placeholders_expected\": int(\"${EXPECTED_PH}\"),\n  \"chart_placeholders_replaced\": int(\"${REPLACED_PH}\"),\n  \"chart_placeholders_remaining\": int(\"${REMAINING_PH}\"),\n  \"meta_stripped\": True,\n  \"rank_math_applied\": True,\n  \"content_format\": \"gutenberg_blocks\",\n  \"seo_title\": \"\"\"${EXTRACTED_TITLE}\"\"\",\n  \"focus_keyword\": \"\"\"${FOCUS_KEYWORD}\"\"\",\n}\nwith open(\"/tmp/wp-result.json\", \"w\") as f:\n    json.dump(result, f, indent=2)\nprint(json.dumps(result, indent=2))\nPYEOF\n\n# =============================================================================\n# PHASE 5: Record History\n# =============================================================================\nif [ -f \"/tmp/openclaw_active_url.txt\" ]; then\n  ACTIVE_URL=$(cat /tmp/openclaw_active_url.txt)\n  log_info \"Recording article history for URL: $ACTIVE_URL\"\n  bash ~/.openclaw/workspace-wp-publisher/skills/history/article_history.sh add \"$ACTIVE_URL\"\n  rm -f \"/tmp/openclaw_active_url.txt\"\nfi\n\necho \"SUCCESS: $POST_URL\"\nexit 0\n[... 5533 more characters truncated]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779265127424}}
